data: {"id": "e7b0fff7375d4be2-thinking-parallel_evidence-1477", "run_id": "e7b0fff7375d4be2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集的实体身份与生命周期：\n- Pod: `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx`，UID `52361280-45fe-4ec1-a8f0-292e82b90b8c`\n- 当前状态：**Running**（所有条件 Initialized/Ready/ContainersReady/PodScheduled 均为 True）\n- 容器 `app`：image `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，command `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py`\n- **重启次数：9 次**，上次重启原因：**Error**，exitCode=78\n- Events：`Back-off restarting failed container app`（89 次 over 22m），表明 Pod 长期处于 CrashLoopBackOff 周期，但 kubelet 最终将其拉回到 Running 状态\n\n应用日志关键信号：\n- 两条 ERROR 日志均记录 `eve", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788445305285, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

