data: {"id": "e7b0fff7375d4be2-final", "run_id": "e7b0fff7375d4be2", "seq": 1482, "ts_ms": 1788445322719, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx` | CrashLoopBackOff | 应用配置缺失（CONFIG_MISSING） |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason: Error` | 直接证明应用容器非正常退出，符合配置缺失导致的启动失败特征 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning BackOff restarting failed container app` (x89 over 22m) | 证实集群因容器反复崩溃触发指数退避机制，处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.last_exit_code: 78` | 退出码 78 通常关联特定的应用级异常（如配置不可用），与日志错误码一致 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `cpu request: 20m / limit: 200m; memory request: 24Mi / limit: 96Mi` | 证明该容器资源配额设定合理，排除因 OOMKill 或 CPU Throttling 导致重启的可能 |\n| 5 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.restart_count: 9` | 确认异常处于持续发生的状态，与 22 分钟的 BackOff 时间窗口吻合 |\n| 6 | Logging | elasticsearch | `CONFIG_MISSING` (error, path: /work, http_status: 500) (8 occurrences) | 在应用层直接定位到根因为“配置缺失”，明确错误性质 |\n| 7 | Tracing | tempo | `GET /work` response_code: 500, `aiops.observed_mode: config_missing_exit` | 追踪数据确认应用在处理请求时主动退出（Exit），且观察到 16ms-27ms 的短耗时，表明应用启动后立即终止 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\n日志（#6）与追踪数据（#7）在应用层形成闭环，明确指向 `CONFIG_MISSING` 是触发应用退出的原因；Kubernetes 的 `BackOff` 事件（#2）和退出码 78（#3）是应用层异常在基础设施层面的直接映射。资源配置（#4）排除了资源争抢作为干扰项。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用配置缺失（CONFIG_MISSING） → 容器启动检查配置失败，主动退出(Exit Code 78) → kubelet 持续尝试重启并触发 BackOff → 应用处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，无法提供服务\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **应用配置缺失（CONFIG_MISSING）**。\n\n该结论由以下事实支撑：\n1.  **应用层直接证据**：日志记录了 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误（证据#6），追踪跨度显示应用以 `config_missing_exit` 模式退出 HTTP 500 响应（证据#7）。\n2.  **基础设施映射一致**：容器启动失败（Evidence#1）、应用退出码 78（Evidence#3）以及 Kubernetes 的 `CrashLoopBackOff` 事件（Evidence#2）完全符合配置错误导致应用无法启动的行为模型。\n3.  **排除其他原因**：资源请求与限制设定正常（证据#4），无 OOM 迹象。\n\n**未确认事实**：\n具体缺失的是哪一个 ConfigMap Key 或环境变量未定义（即 `unknowns` 中提到的内容），当前证据仅确认了存在缺失的配置项，但未指出具体字段名。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 24.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 59.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx: 59.6s (Evidence 53.7s, RCA 5.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 95.83, "metrics": {"run_id": "e7b0fff7375d4be2", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 95.83776617050171, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "51%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.8667, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3333333333333333, "weighted_score": 0.0667}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score": 0.19, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 95%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 95837.76617050171, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 69379.11486625671, "tool_calls": 12, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 33521.435260772705, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 26034.2538356781}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 24803.539514541626, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 59603.25002670288, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11408.645153045654, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

